      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HEREFORAGOODTIME (2) had a favourable gate and was too good at this track two runs ago. Drew wide last start and was safely held, beaten 16 metres into fifth at this track over 1800m. Sure to enjoy a soft trip in the running run from this draw. Needs to be at his best to beat this field but he is up to the challenge. DELIGHTFUL DREAM (9) has a strong record here which is significant. Finished eighth over 1800m at this track last time out after having won here two runs back as the $1.65 favourite after having raced outside the leader for the entire trip. SPLASH OF PAYNT (8) is the best of the rest after finishing sixth over 2230m at this track last time out after he led at the bell. Has won nine of his 11 career wins here.",
